"Call tcres_query_listing_items() inside the element. It prints the loading "
"marker, the empty and error templates, and the cards of the registered query."
" Scope applies. A checked toolbar control does not, until the visitor "
"changes a control. A later request removes any other child of that element."
msgstr ""
